# =============================================================================
# [BitTV fork] m3u-flussonic-tivimate.patch
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Flussonic archive для TiviMate (Android) на MaxPain/tuliprox develop (v3.3.74+).
# TiviMate шлёт ?utc=&lutc= на proxy URL (не m3u-catchup token).
# Строит provider URL: .../archive-{start}-{duration}.m3u8 (+ timeshift_abs fallback).
# Экспорт M3U: catchup-type=flussonic, catchup-source=?utc={utc}&lutc={lutc}.
# Применять поверх upstream/develop; m3u-catchup-compat не обязателен.
# =============================================================================
#
